Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.03,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI가 만든 티 나는
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,화면, {\c&H003BD4FF}스킬{\c&H00FFFFFF} 하나로
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,바뀝니다
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.03,0:00:06.00,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H003BD4FF}보라색{\c&H00FFFFFF} 그라데이션에 똑같은
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,카드, 익숙하죠?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.90,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,깃허브 저장소 {\c&H003BD4FF}언슬롭{\c&H00FFFFFF},
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,클로드용 스킬이에요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.18,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,나온 지 {\c&H003BD4FF}8일{\c&H00FFFFFF} 만에 별 만
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,개를 넘겼어요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.83,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H003BD4FF}바이브코딩{\c&H00FFFFFF} UI를 디자인된
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,화면으로 다듬어 줘요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.32,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H003BD4FF}설치{\c&H00FFFFFF}는 화면에 나온 방법
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,그대로 따라 하면 돼요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.87,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,그다음 같은 페이지를 {\c&H003BD4FF}다시{\c&H00FFFFFF}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,만들어 달라고 하세요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.39,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,적용 전과 후, {\c&H003BD4FF}차이{\c&H00FFFFFF}가
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,바로 보이죠
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.39,0:00:23.76,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,디자인 감각 없어도 {\c&H003BD4FF}결과물{\c&H00FFFFFF}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,수준이 올라가요
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.76,Label,,0,0,0,,github.com/heydamir/unslop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:25.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,언슬롭, 랜딩페이지 만들
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,때 쓰게 {\c&H003BD4FF}저장{\c&H00FFFFFF}해 두세요
